EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

We have been attempting to reach you regarding your account that has moved into default for non-payment due to being {!Case.Payments_Behind__c} {!Case.Payment_Frequency__c} payments behind schedule. There is still time to resolve your account, but we need to hear from you to discuss possible options.

Please contact us to so we can work together to get this resolved as soon as possible. My contact information can be found at the bottom of this email.


Thank you,

{!Case.OwnerFullName} | {!Case.OwnerTitle}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!Case.OwnerPhone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!Case.OwnerEmail}
